      "name": "aawood",
      "username": "aawood",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/8e8cbc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-05-23T11:33:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In another time, on another topic, mwc146 said:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Let Nightmist or Visionary be the lowest HP, and they can waste their time punching an invincible cocoon or mist (or, in Nightmist's case, punching themselves in the face).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That got me thinking; It sounds like it could be a viable strategy to Cocoon Visionary at soon as possible, get Nightmist down and mist her, and between them absorb all the highest/lowest target damage, nullifying a great deal of many villains' damage output.</p>\n<p>Has anyone tried this? Is there anyone this would be particularly strong/weak against?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:31.545Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
