      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "In another time, on another topic, mwc146 said:\n\n \n[quote=\"mwc146\"]\n \n\nLet Nightmist or Visionary be the lowest HP, and they can waste their time punching an invincible cocoon or mist (or, in Nightmist&#39;s case, punching themselves in the face).\n\n[/quote]\n\nThat got me thinking; It sounds like it could be a viable strategy to Cocoon Visionary at soon as possible, get Nightmist down and mist her, and between them absorb all the highest/lowest target damage, nullifying a great deal of many villains&#39; damage output.\n\nHas anyone tried this? Is there anyone this would be particularly strong/weak against?\n",
