      "username": "saykhia",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/saykhia/{size}/2132_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-05-24T05:05:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Against Progeny it is almost a guaranteed win, and you only need either of them (not both). Take one down low enough and turn on god mode. Progeny flips and obsessively wails an invincible wall.</p>\n<p>Works better with Skyscraper though, as her incap side on Huge seems almost tailored for Progeny.</p>\n<p>As others have pointed out, player selected for god mode duty will be bored as hell. Not something you generally sign up for when playing Nightmist!</p>",
