      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-05-24T06:21:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's hard to keep an entire party safe against Infinitor, but on the other hand his self damage and inability to destroy ongoings means that Nightmist or Visionary can turtle their way to victory even if the rest of the team is destroyed along the way. &nbsp;Some environments might give you trouble, though.</p>",
