      "username": "darkroydante",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/darkroydante/{size}/2044_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-13T02:51:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's pretty decent against Apostate. He and Condemnation target the highest on his front side, and so by extention this strategy mitigates the Gauntlets and the Peri... the 4 HP relic. His demon which does damage also targets the highest. One of his one-shots targets the highest as well. I had to leave a game during the second round once, to take a call, and I told my brother to play for me, and handed him mistform. Apparently she stayed that way for most of the game.&nbsp;</p>",
